&lt;li&gt;Analyze market trends and customer behavior within Spain to identify opportunities for improvement and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish strong relationships with customers to ensure satisfaction, product adoption, and contract renewal.&lt;/li&gt;
