&lt;li&gt;Operational Excellence: Maintain accurate health metrics, notes, and success plans in CRM for full portfolio visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have prior experience in customer success, account management, or customer support roles in a SaaS or technology environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language Requirements: Native-Level Mandarin and strong professional English language skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to drive product adoption, customer satisfaction (NPS), and retention results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technically confident and able to guide customers through setup, usage, and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and relationship-building skills across multiple stakeholder levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with data and insights to identify trends, risks, and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized with excellent follow-through and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative team player who enjoys working with Account Managers, Product, and Marketing to deliver customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine passion for helping customers succeed and seeing measurable business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good understanding of the digital advertising/search marketing industry – preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are passionate about what we do. Our Commercial organization is diverse, collaborative, and it is a fun place to work. Our culture is fast-paced, and our employees grow as we do. You will have plenty of personal development and coaching opportunities. We are a global organization with a head office in Copenhagen, Denmark.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A range of flexible working options to dedicate time to what matters to you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation package including quarterly commission and annual company bonus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days holiday (plus public holidays)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Two (paid) volunteering days a year to spend your time giving back to the causes that matter to you and your community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rich learning and development opportunities supported through the Trustpilot Academy and Blinkist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Superannuation, salary continuance and life insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full access to Headspace, a popular mindfulness app-based service designed to promote positive mental health and access to a 24/7 Employee Assistance Plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to work scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A buzzy office at 55 Collins Street with a fully stocked fridge and all the snacks and refreshments you can ask for There are also regular socials, lunches and fun offsite strategy sessions — and tons of opportunities to connect and have fun as a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Still not sure?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want to be a part of creating a more diverse, equitable, and inclusive world of work for all. We’re excited to hear about your experiences, along with how you will contribute to our working culture. Even if you don’t feel you meet all the requirements, we&#39;d still really like to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid #LI-JS1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Trustpilot began in 2007 with a simple yet powerful idea that is more relevant today than ever — to be the universal symbol of trust, bringing consumers and businesses together through reviews. Trustpilot is open, independent, and impartial — we help consumers make the right choices and businesses to build trust, grow and improve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, we have more than 350 million reviews and 60 million monthly active users across the globe, with 149 billion annual Trustpilot brand impressions, and the numbers keep growing. We have more than 1000 employees and we’re headquartered in Copenhagen, with operations in&amp;nbsp; Amsterdam, Denver, Edinburgh, Hamburg, London, Melbourne, Milan and New York.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re driven by connection. It’s at the heart of what we do. Our culture keeps things fresh –– it’s built on the relationships we create. We talk, we laugh, we collaborate and we respect each other. We work across borders and cultures to be the universal symbol of trust in an ever-changing world. With vibrant office locations worldwide and over 50 nationalities, we’re proud to be an equal opportunity workplace with diverse perspectives and ideas.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our purpose to help people and businesses help each other is a tall order, but we keep it real. We’re a great bunch of humans, doing awesome stuff, without fuss or pretense. A successful Trustpilot future is driven by you –– we give you the autonomy to shape a career you can be proud of. If you’re ready to grow, let’s go.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us at the heart of trust.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Trustpilot is committed to creating an inclusive environment where people from all backgrounds can thrive and where different viewpoints and experiences are valued and respected. Trustpilot will consider all applications for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, national origin, religious beliefs, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, neurodiversity, disability, age, parental or veteran status. Together, we are the heart of trust.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Trustpilot is a global company and our data practices are designed to ensure that your personally identifiable information is appropriately protected. Please note that your personal information will be transferred, accessed, and stored globally as necessary for the uses and disclosures stated in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://corporate.trustpilot.com/legal/for-everyone/data-privacy-notice-for-candidates/dec-2025&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;If you have a disability and would like to discuss any adjustments you might need either in submitting your application, or to the recruitment process more generally, please let us know by contacting our Talent Acquisition Team (redacted@example.com)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;quoting the role you wish to apply for.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Trustpilot, we&#39;re on an incredible journey. We&#39;re a profitable, high-growth FTSE-250 company with a big vision: to become the universal symbol of trust. We run the world&#39;s largest open customer review platform, and while we&#39;ve come a long way, there&#39;s still so much exciting work to do. Come join us at the heart of trust!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The CX Governance &amp;amp; Service Standards Manager within the Customer Experience Performance (CEP) team leads the design and governance of the future company-wide scaling of Trustpilot’s service standards, for service excellence and continuous improvement across Customer Experience &amp;amp; Support (CES) and the wider Trustpilot organization. Leading the strategic function CX Governance &amp;amp; Service Standards, this role drives Trustpilot’s evolution toward a proactive, closed-loop resolution engine. It leads the enterprise Voice of the Customer (VoC) governance rhythm, chairs the cross-functional Global VoC Forum, and directs the company-wide &#39;Fix the Basics&#39; initiative to eliminate avoidable customer contacts at the root. Additionally, the role anchors service quality, governing&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;The Trustpilot Experience: Service Standard while actively supporting any customer-facing teams across Trustpilot that would want to tailor and apply these standards to their specific operational workflows, systematically reducing customer effort and increasing the experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Global Voice of the Customer (VoC) Closed-Loop Governance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;VoC Forum Leadership: Chair, and direct the Global VoC Forum, bringing together cross-functional leadership across all operational, commercial, and technical business owners to drive collective ownership and end-to-end accountability for eliminating customer friction points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Closed-Loop Feedback Engine: Govern the &quot;Listen-Analyze-Act-Monitor&quot; lifecycle by translating end-to-end customer listening signals and contact diagnostics into validated, prioritized roadmap solutions across all relevant business units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CX Maturity Benchmarking: Execute, track, and advance internal CX maturity baselines across Trustpilot teams, ensuring trust metrics directly inform business strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&quot;Fix the Basics&quot; Failure-Points Elimination&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Macro Root-Cause Analysis: Direct the macro &quot;Fix the Basics&quot; program, analyzing contact drivers and support data to identify the underlying product, policy, and workflow failures that generate avoidable customer contact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The best service is no service: Partnering directly with Product teams and GTM leads to feed contact-driver insights and rapid product-release bugs straight into product roadmaps, embedding &quot;the best service is no service&quot; philosophy across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Effort Reduction: Continuously benchmark and optimize customer touchpoints to systematically lower the Customer Effort Score (CES) across human and digital interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Trustpilot Experience: Service Standard&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rollout &amp;amp; Governance: Lead the operational rollout and continuous governance of &lt;em&gt;The Trustpilot Experience: Service Standard&lt;/em&gt; within CES and where suited across other customer touchpoints, unifying expectations for speed, accuracy, empathetic tone, plain-language policy translation, and First-Contact Resolution (FCR).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core Values Integration: Operationalize Trustpilot’s 5 core values (&lt;em&gt;Start with Customer, Act with Integrity, Positively Human, Make It Happen, Win Together&lt;/em&gt;) into clear operational expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-Departmental Application opportunity: Provide tailored service delivery guidelines for specialized functions. like Customer Support, Digital CS, Content Integrity, Trust &amp;amp; Enforcement, Billing/Finance, Product Support, and Commercial teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To maximize impact without operational overlap, this role maintains a crisp division of labor between CEP&#39;s governance engine and frontline partner teams:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;VoC Governance: CEP owns the global VoC data infrastructure, centralizing feedback into Looker/Salesforce and tracking macro resolution metrics. The CX &amp;amp; Community Advocacy Team shapes the qualitative agenda, curates customer narrative case studies, and defines focal themes for executive reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Jira Escalations &amp;amp; Failure Elimination: CEP maintains the macro &quot;Fix the Basics&quot; Jira tracking board and statistical root-cause correlation. The CX Managers log domain-specific qualitative issues from frontline interactions and upvote systemic friction with Product pods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Standards &amp;amp; Playbooks: CEP owns the overarching service standards and audit frameworks. The CX &amp;amp; Community Advocacy Team author B2B/B2C help guides, CSM 1-to-many playbooks, and brand-voice rules for AI review assistants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Who you are:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CX Strategy &amp;amp; Governance: Experience leading CX Strategy, Voice of the Customer (VoC) programs, Customer Journey Mapping, or Quality Governance within a fast-paced SaaS, digital marketplace, or e-commerce environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Influence: Demonstrated track record of leading cross-departmental forums and influencing Product, Engineering, GTM, and Commercial leaders without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Standards &amp;amp; Frameworks: Experience developing, operationalizing, and auditing customer service delivery standards, quality rubrics, and closed-loop governance engines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Influence &amp;amp; Diplomatic Persistence: Ability to build strong relationships across Product, Legal, GTM, and Support teams while holding stakeholders accountable to customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Root-Cause Diagnostic Capability: Skilled at synthesizing qualitative customer sentiment, ticket logs, and contact drivers into compelling root-cause business cases.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Values-Driven Customer Advocacy: Deep alignment with Trustpilot&#39;s core values, with a passion for eliminating corporate jargon and placing human empathy at the center of process design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A range of flexible working options to dedicate time to what matters to you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation package + bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days holiday per year, increasing to 28 days after 2 years of employment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Two (paid) volunteering days a year to spend your time giving back to the causes that matter to you and your community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rich learning and development opportunities are supported through the Trustpilot Academy and Blinkist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension and life insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health cash plan, online GP, 24/7, Employee Assistance Plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full access to Headspace, a popular mindfulness app to promote positive mental health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Season ticket loan and a cycle-to-work scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Central office location complete with pool table, a gaming corner, coffee bars and all the snacks and refreshments you can ask for&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular opportunities to connect and get to know your fellow Trusties, including company-wide celebrations and events, Trustie Community activities, and team socials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to over 4,000 deals and discounts on things like travel, electronics, fashion, fitness, cinema discounts, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independent financial advice and free standard professional mortgage broker advice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Talent acceleration programs: Fast-track your career with our tailored development programs designed to support growth at whatever stage of your career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Still not sure?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want to be a part of creating a more diverse, equitable, and inclusive world of work for all. We’re excited to hear about your experiences along with how you will contribute to our working culture. Even if you don’t feel you meet all the requirements, we&#39;d still really like to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
